<section id="about" class="section-padding bg-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 lg:gap-32 items-center">
            <div class="reveal-up">
                <div class="relative">
                    <img src="/images/portfolio/mitre-1.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl shadow-heavy" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-12 reveal-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms">
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h2 class="heading-lg">About.</h2>
                </div>
                
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <p class="text-readable">
                        With years of hands-on experience across Melbourne, Anthony Calocani delivers exceptional tiling outcomes for both residential homes and commercial properties. We work with ceramic, porcelain, marble and natural stone — always with the same standard of precision that defines every project we take on.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-readable">
                        From full bathroom renovations and kitchen splashbacks to outdoor patios, balconies and staircases, we manage every stage with care. Our work includes structural preparation, cement screeding, waterproofing and finishing — so your project is handled by one trusted team from start to finish.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-readable">
                        We use Tradsiee's video enquiry system for faster, more accurate quoting. Simply record the area on any device and we'll assess the work before we step foot on site, saving time and eliminating guesswork.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="pt-8">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">Get a Quote</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
